// REJECTS: Unexpected token ';'. Valid alternatives: ['[', '(', '<']
//
// Multiplicity is NOT optional on a Pure property. `code: String;` is the shape every
// other schema language in the world would accept and default to "exactly one"; Legend
// requires [1] written out.
//
// This is precisely the kind of rule a rewrite relaxes by accident -- defaulting a missing
// multiplicity to [1] is a one-line convenience that makes strictly more models load, so
// no test fails. It then produces protocol that legend-engine will refuse, and the model
// is portable in exactly one direction.
###Pure
Class fixture::neg::NoMultiplicity
{
   code: String;
}
